# Draft private uniform-page span proof

Source-only candidate based on unchanged `fe1eff2039520536350922a2164c8bbe29404c68`. It is independent of dispatch candidate e7/2c and does not change original 103 files or load the compiled addon.

`provider.mjs` has four exact inverse derivation seams: relocated reset-witness import, distinct factory name, captured decoder/classifier references, and one private subclass `span` method. No read/write/PAGE/clock method or generic file is rewritten. `span-method.txt` is the exact inserted method; `derive.mjs` verifies the inverse against the unchanged provider. `baseline-source.json` retains all original 103 source hashes and original compiled-addon identity, without using the addon.

Invalid arguments delegate to original validation. The fast proof requires the pinned decoder/classifier identities, aligned bounded reset-alias base, no MP/VGA overlay, an actual nonoverflowing decoded span in one page of backing, actual RAM/ROM `_page` kind matching original classification, no intersecting actual MMIO, and original execute predicate. The existing A20 bit-20 gate and reset threshold are page aligned, making this pinned decoder affine within a valid raw page. Decode occurs before original video-priority classification. No decoded mapping is cached. All misses use original `span`, including unsupported values, slow/unmapped pages, altered decoder, overlays and disallowed executable pages.

Before running, root/peer review the source and controls. Run exactly one bounded source-control child after review: nice +10, 512 MiB Node heap, CPU/wall 120 s, file 256 MiB, core zero and blank NODE_OPTIONS/NODE_PATH/LD_PRELOAD/LD_AUDIT plus no profiling flags. The unchanged factory's bounded as/ld/objcopy reconstruction of its fixed ROM is allowed; no native compilation or CPU guest execution is performed.

`controls.mjs` binds original 103 and seven new inputs before/after. It runs serially and generates two exact-inverse test-only derivatives that capture their private board for oracle and mutation controls; the production provider gains no live board API. The test files are removed on exit and their hashes retained in stdout. No exhaustive page×offset×width cross-product: every configured page gets classification and two edge spans in both A20 states; relevant RAM/ROM/high aliases get exhaustive 4096-byte decoder/classifier checks, representative widths 1–16, and full PAGE byte/effect comparisons; 1024 seeded spans and bounded denial cases cover remaining boundaries. Controls cover all 64 PAGE and generation slots, before-effect rejection, decoder interior nonaffinity, mixed/MMIO/overlay fallbacks, mapping/lease chronology, malformed complete tapes, independent caps, production factory sink reentry/exceptions and whole RAM digests.

Passing source controls establishes no native parity, speed result, full AT/Windows/Doom admission, or 10× claim. Any later native work waits for the existing dispatch gate verdict and separate authorization/review.
